<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>확장·컨텍스트·범위 on JsonXcel Learn</title><link>https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m04-expansion-context/</link><description>Recent content in 확장·컨텍스트·범위 on JsonXcel Learn</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ko-KR</language><atom:link href="https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m04-expansion-context/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>셀 확장(목록 전개)</title><link>https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m04-expansion-context/m04-l01-expansion/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m04-expansion-context/m04-l01-expansion/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이 페이지는 한국어 입구입니다. 상세 기술 설명은 당분간 영어/간체가 기준입니다. 마커·JSON 키·&lt;code&gt;template_name&lt;/code&gt;은 모든 언어에서 동일합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id="learning-objectives"&gt;Learning objectives&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Place collection markers such as &lt;code&gt;{{ds.lines.sku}}&lt;/code&gt; on a template row so the engine inserts one row per element&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set expansion direction with &lt;code&gt;E=V&lt;/code&gt; (vertical, default) or &lt;code&gt;E=H&lt;/code&gt; (horizontal)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep non-list fields outside the expanding band so headers stay put&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
